<title>USA: Compaq rises on stock split news.</title>
<headline>Compaq rises on stock split news.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Compaq Computer Corp rose as investors viewed its five-for-two stock split news as a bullish signal for Compaq's future, amid a decline in other leading technology stocks, traders said.</p>
<p>Wall Street analysts said that the stock split will simply drive more retail interest in the stock.</p>
<p>&quot;Companies like to have their stock trade at prices that are attractive to various levels of investors,&quot; said Mark Specker, a SoundView Financial analyst.</p>
<p>Compaq shares rose 1-07/16 to 100-15/16 on more than 2.9 million shares traded.</p>
</text>
